 "summary": "A series of 34 axial-lead silicon planar Zener diodes in the DO-41 (DO-204AL) package, rated 1300 mW, with nominal Zener voltages from 3.3 V to 75 V at a standard tolerance of ±5 %. Each diode is a single device; the voltage is specified at thermal equilibrium. Applications: voltage stabilization; stabilizing and clipping circuits at high power. 1N4734A-TAP is the 5.6 V part on 52 mm ammopack tape.",
