  {
   "topic": "Zener voltage measurement",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "VZ is a DC figure taken at thermal equilibrium at the test current IZT1, with the lead temperature held at 30 °C 9.5 mm from the body. ZZT is measured at IZT1 and ZZK at the lower knee current IZT2, both at 1 kHz."
